# The Northrop Grumman B-2A Spirit, four F118-GE-100s: a flight model
# written for glideslope from what is published of it - its size, weights and
# engines, and its speed, ceiling and range (assets/figures/b2.xml) - by
# tools/make_b2.py.
#
#   name TEXT...                 what it is called
#   model NAME                   its JSBSim model, in data/jsbsim/aircraft
#   start AIRSPEED_KT THROTTLE   a flight begun in the air: its calibrated
#                                airspeed, and the throttle that holds it
#
# Its published figures, if it has them, are data/figures/MODEL.xml, and its
# selftest's log data/selftest/MODEL.log (src/sim/catalogue.hpp).

name Northrop Grumman B-2A Spirit
model b2
class bomber
start 250 0.48
